id: pm-gh1567
title: "GH-1567: fit whole SDK envelopes using the selected serializer and token budget"
description: "External report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1567. Revalidate the reported 2026.10.23 behavior against the checkout before implementation."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: github-intake,sdk
