completed_at: "2026-10-25T17:25:55.897Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: Inspect existing read-output packing before adding a generic primitive; preserve mandatory envelope metadata and serializer-specific complete packet accounting; validate infeasible budgets and omission receipts
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: 70
resolution: "Add fitOutputEnvelope to aggregate/query SDK exports and the injected package SDK, with receipt-inclusive fixed-point measurements, prefix/skip policies, custom renderers/estimators, finite work limits, truthful omissions and readonly reserved receipt types."
expected_result: Package authors fit complete context packets within every required rendering budget while retaining mandatory metadata and actionable bounded refusal evidence.
actual_result: "36 linked SDK/host tests pass, 49 correction/packed Node/Bun checks pass, all TypeScript consumers compile, receipt-exclusion and reserved-type negative controls detect regressions. Exact-head full hosted coverage and review remain required merge gates; this source work is Unreleased."
